<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<%- include('./partials/head.ejs') %>

    <body>

        <%- include('./partials/nav.ejs') %>

            <div class="case-studies">
                <h2> Case Studies </h2>

                <h3> Our Ability: Redesigning job search dashboard </h3>
                <p>
                    Our Ability helps people with disabilities find work. When I joined, people using screen readers
                    couldn't
                    finish the
                    profile form, job search had no filters, and text contrast failed accessibility minimums. I was the
                    only
                    designer. Over
                    12 weeks I redesigned the candidate dashboard and the chatbot across four rounds, including one that
                    failed
                    testing and
                    got thrown out.
                </p>

                <button> View Case Study </button>

                <h3> OrangeWork Hub: replacing paper shift scheduling for Syracuse student workers </h3>
                <p>
                    A mobile app for scheduling, swapping, and dropping shifts, built for Syracuse student workers who
                    were
                    stuck using
                    paper sign-ups and slow email. Solo project, 16 weeks. I lived this problem myself at Halal Shack
                    before I
                    designed it.
                </p>

                <button> View Case Study </button>

                <% if(caseStudies.length> 0 )
                    { %>
                    <% caseStudies.forEach( caseStudy=>
                        { %>
                        <h3 class="title">
                            <%= caseStudy.title %>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="body">
                            <%= caseStudy.body %>
                        </p>
                        <% }) %>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <p> There are no case studies to display... </p>
                                <% } %>
            </div>

            <%- include('./partials/footer.ejs') %>
    </body>

</html>